After-Image #2 (Right – Groundsplitter Windup):
Pose: Low crouch, sword held reverse (blade pointing backward), right gauntlet forward as if directing a wave. Left hand touching the ground.
Energy: Concentric ripples of blue energy radiating from the gauntlet's palm, depicted as ink splatters with a central glow.
