No dialogue yet.

PANEL 2 (Medium, healer's diagnosis – 12% height): Close-up on the Elder Healer's face as he examines Alucard's arm. His expression is grave, lips pressed thin. Alucard is semi-conscious, eyes barely open, his face pale and sweating. The black veins on his neck are visible. Speech bubble from Elder Healer (low, to an assistant): "The corruption has reached his shoulder. Another day, and it would have taken his heart. We cannot cut it out – it has fused to his blood." Assistant's bubble (whispered, horrified): "Then what do we do?" Elder Healer (pause): "We contain it. Or he dies."

PANEL 3 (Small, vertical – 8% height): A close-up on Alucard's face, eyes half-closed, his lips moving weakly. He is whispering something. Speech bubble from Alucard (faint, dashed outline): "My father... I can't... not yet..." No reply.

